</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 992)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Voice replies.</b> The mic beside a reply's paperclip records a spoken reply (a minute at most) that sends when you stop. It plays from the &#9654; before its text, under the same voices mute (&#8679;M) as voice notes, and is transcribed like a note &#8212; on your Mac for your own, on the host for a web seat's.</li>
<li><b>Web:</b> the same mic on the reply row (hold, release to send); a reply's transcript that arrives after the reply now lands without a refresh.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
